OL,3,GNEWSANew exhibition to show secrets of
OL,4,Apier restoration
OL,5,
OL,6,FNew pictures and artefacts are going on
OL,7,Fdisplay to offer people a rare look
OL,8,Finto one of the UK's largest pier
OL,9,Frestorations.
OL,11,FAn exhibition is opening next month
OL,12,Fshowcasing a gallery of
OL,13,Fbehind-the-scenes photographs depicting
OL,14,Fwork to revamp the Victorian Birnbeck
OL,15,FPier at Weston-super-Mare in Somerset.
OL,17,FThe event at Weston Museum will also
OL,18,Finclude metalwork from the original
OL,19,Fpier, which first opened in 1867, as
OL,20,Fwell as "unusual finds" uncovered
OL,21,Fduring the #20m restoration project.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,349,340,200,160,0,100
