OL,3,GNEWSANew exhibition to show secrets of
OL,4,Apier restoration
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillor Mark Canniford, North
OL,7,FSomerset Council's lead for the
OL,8,FBirnbeck Pier project, said: "This
OL,9,Fexhibition is a great way for people to
OL,10,Fdiscover what's happening behind the
OL,11,Fconstruction site fencing."
